];
const law = [
  ['Illinois · BIPA', '$1,000 to $5,000', 'Per violation, negligent to reckless, with a private right of action. Written consent and a retention schedule are required before any voiceprint exists. F', 'Nine coordinated suits landed in May 2026 against Adobe, Google, Amazon, Apple, ElevenLabs, Meta, Microsoft, NVIDIA and Samsung over voiceprints taken for AI training. F Whether a prosody feature is a voiceprint is unsettled. Q'],
